  "description": "Upgrade your 2022-2026 Toyota Tundra Double Cab with OEDRO Two-Step Running Boards. Featuring a dual-level drop step design, forged carbon steel construction, and corrosion-resistant powder coating, these heavy-duty side steps provide easier cab access, enhanced protection, anti-slip traction, and 550 lbs support for work or off-road adventures.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit for 2022-2026 Toyota Tundra Double Cab: Engineered specifically for 2022-2026 Toyota Tundra Double Cab models, OEDRO running boards deliver a precise fit while enhancing truck accessibility, protection, and rugged styling.\nDual-Level Drop Step Design for Easy Access: The innovative two-step layout provides a lower entry step and upper access platform, making it easier to enter the cab, reach the roof, and load cargo—especially for lifted trucks and oversized tires.\nHeavy-Duty Carbon Steel Construction: Made from forged carbon steel with a durable powder-coated finish, these nerf bars offer superior strength, corrosion resistance, and long-lasting performance in harsh weather and off-road environments.\nReinforced 76mm Tube & Anti-Slip Step Surface: The extra-thick 76mm main tube structure improves load-bearing capability, while grooved step plates provide reliable traction and secure footing in rain, mud, snow, and everyday driving conditions.\nDual-Layer Structure for Stability & Protection: The reinforced dual-layer design enhances stepping stability while helping protect your truck’s lower body from rocks, debris, and trail hazards, adding both function and aggressive off-road style.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2022-2026 Toyota Tundra Double Cab",
